                <head>156. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>An informal meeting of Foreign Ministers of the American Republics was held
                    October 2-3, 1962, in Washington. In addition to Secretary Rusk, the participants included 17 Foreign
                    Ministers or Acting Foreign Ministers, Special Representatives from Argentina
                    and Brazil, and the Chairman of the Council of the Organization of American
                    States. No formal, agreed records of the meetings were made. U.S. memoranda of
                    conversation recording the four sessions are in Department of State, Central
                    Files 371.04/10-262 and 371.04/10-362. The texts are scheduled for inclusion in
                    the <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v10-12mSupp">microfiche supplement to Foreign
                        Relations, 1961–1963, volume XI</ref>. See also <ref target="#d157">Document
                        157</ref>. Related material is in Department of State, Conference Files: Lot
                    65 D 533, CF 2168-2171.</p>
            </div>
